####################################################################
#  Italian Consciousnet meta script.
#  Based on annette.meta, with parser/control fields intentionally
#  left in the original Eliza.pm syntax.
#
#  Do not translate these control words:
#  initial, final, quit, pre, post, synon, key, decomp, reasmb,
#  reasm_for_memory, goto, NET, REXP, xnone.
#
#  Placeholder notes:
#  - decomp wildcards and @synon matches become (1), (2), ...
#  - reasmb lines rebuild answers by inserting those placeholders.
#  - reasmb lines starting with NET are not shown directly. entity.pl
#    strips NET and sends the remaining text to web search.
#
#  This file is ASCII-only on purpose for compatibility with old Perl
#  installations and the current Eliza.pm script loader.

initial: va bene, iniziamo, raccontami qualcosa

final: Arrivederci. Mi ha fatto piacere parlare con te
final: Arrivederci. Spero che questa conversazione ti sia stata utile
final: Penso che potresti parlare piu spesso con un analista. Ciao!
final: La vita e difficile. Tieni duro!

